From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 05:29:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: keep suggesting an alias typed in full

matchingPeers required the alias to be longer than the query, so the
suggestion disappeared exactly when the whole alias was entered and the
chance to pick it was gone.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
---
 TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/helpers/Aliases.kt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/helpers/Aliases.kt b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/helpers/Aliases.kt
index e15c67e6b..dd38e6a9d 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/helpers/Aliases.kt
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/helpers/Aliases.kt
@@ -162,7 +162,7 @@ object Aliases {
             map.forEach { (key, id) ->
                 if (!key.startsWith("$account:")) return@forEach
                 val alias = key.substring(account.toString().length + 1)
-                if (if (anywhere) alias.contains(q) else alias.startsWith(q) && alias.length > q.length) {
+                if (if (anywhere) alias.contains(q) else alias.startsWith(q)) {
                     out.add(android.util.Pair(alias, id))
                 }
             }
